[en.DECISION_C02_C11_INFORMATION]
What does the Plush Toys have to say

[en.DECISION_C02_C11_INFORMATION_TOOLTIP]
We have been so indulgent in allowing the Changelings to infiltrate Ponyville, and now it has finally paid off.
The Changelings’ intelligence may be able to point us in the right direction, but of course, this will not be without cost.

[en.DECISION_C02_C11_INFORMATION_desc]


[zh.DECISION_C02_C11_INFORMATION]
听听毛绒玩具们怎么说

[zh.DECISION_C02_C11_INFORMATION_TOOLTIP]
我们如此放纵幻形灵在小马谷渗透，如今终于有了好处。
幻形灵的情报也许可以为我们指一条明路，不过当然，这也不会毫无代价。

[zh.DECISION_C02_C11_INFORMATION_desc]
